{"schema":"hsr-dialogue.v1","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-23","referenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","textReferenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","sourceIds":["event-rogue-23"],"missing":0,"rows":[{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-23-talk-403811801-line","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-23","missionId":"event-rogue-23","mission":"사회적 꿈","scene":"사회적 꿈","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"피어포인트 행성에서 가장 사랑스러운 키레라어 선식관에 들어선다——이곳은 거대한 어안 기포로 만들어진 곳이다. 아치형 유리를 통해 아공간 장벽을 볼 수 있는 이곳에서 여유로운 오후의 햇빛을 즐기며 나만의 시간을 보낸다","talkId":403811801,"textHash":"134315312328231872","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:23/talk-403811801","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"516efa9692d8c495","bwikiNextIds":["swarm-disaster-event-rogue-23-talk-403811802-line"],"bwikiPage":"社会性梦境","bwikiRevision":58947,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-8774","bwikiMission":"사회적 꿈"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-23-talk-403811802-line","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-23","missionId":"event-rogue-23","mission":"사회적 꿈","scene":"사회적 꿈","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"모든 손님들이 초음어파를 통한 뇌근막 안마에 빠져 있다. 접시에 놓인 *어안*을 한입에 집어삼키자, 사회적 꿈세계가 펼쳐진다. 피어포인트 행성이 여명 발전기를 맞이하고 공중에서 정기적으로 우주 화폐비가 쏟아진다. 당신은 컴퍼니에서 발행한 채권을 움켜쥐고 늘어나는 행복지수를 만끽한다","talkId":403811802,"textHash":"10119058649559069072","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:23/talk-403811802","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"516efa9692d8c495","bwikiNextIds":["swarm-disaster-event-rogue-23-talk-403811803-line"],"bwikiPage":"社会性梦境","bwikiRevision":58947,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-8774","bwikiMission":"사회적 꿈"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-23-talk-403811803-line","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-23","missionId":"event-rogue-23","mission":"사회적 꿈","scene":"사회적 꿈","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"위점막이 어안을 전부 소화하고 나자 꿈에서 깬 당신은 출근 시간이 된 것을 발견한다. 하지만 그곳을 떠나고 싶지 않다…","talkId":403811803,"textHash":"10147049343307647830","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:23/talk-403811803","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"516efa9692d8c495","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"社会性梦境","bwikiRevision":58947,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-8774","bwikiMission":"사회적 꿈"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-23-text-17311819012165719387-choice","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-23","missionId":"event-rogue-23","mission":"사회적 꿈","scene":"사회적 꿈","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"영원히 출근을 안 한다! 영원히…","talkId":null,"textHash":"17311819012165719387","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:23/text-17311819012165719387","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"a208d90a5461accb","bwikiNextIds":["swarm-disaster-event-rogue-23-text-17565055023392789943-effect"],"bwikiPage":"社会性梦境","bwikiRevision":58947,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-8774","bwikiMission":"사회적 꿈"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-23-text-17565055023392789943-effect","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-23","missionId":"event-rogue-23","mission":"사회적 꿈","scene":"사회적 꿈","type":"narration","speaker":"","text":"★2~3 「공허」 축복 1개를 획득한다","talkId":null,"textHash":"17565055023392789943","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:23/text-17565055023392789943","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"a208d90a5461accb","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"社会性梦境","bwikiRevision":58947,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-8774","bwikiMission":"사회적 꿈","bwikiReplyToIds":["swarm-disaster-event-rogue-23-text-17311819012165719387-choice"]},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-23-text-13717816190884124486-choice","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-23","missionId":"event-rogue-23","mission":"사회적 꿈","scene":"사회적 꿈","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"더 많은 물고기 눈을 포획한다……","talkId":null,"textHash":"13717816190884124486","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:23/text-13717816190884124486","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"c6c4b8785ca7b022","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"社会性梦境","bwikiRevision":58947,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-8774","bwikiMission":"사회적 꿈"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-23-text-13738518218215002057-choice","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-23","missionId":"event-rogue-23","mission":"사회적 꿈","scene":"사회적 꿈","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"다른 *물고기 눈* 1개를 삼키고 계속 마사지를 즐긴다","talkId":null,"textHash":"13738518218215002057","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:23/text-13738518218215002057","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"a90042df114609db","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"社会性梦境","bwikiRevision":58947,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-8774","bwikiMission":"사회적 꿈"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-23-text-16133995266322216578-choice","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-23","missionId":"event-rogue-23","mission":"사회적 꿈","scene":"사회적 꿈","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"업무로 복귀한다","talkId":null,"textHash":"16133995266322216578","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:23/text-16133995266322216578","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"b843473702e55fdc","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"社会性梦境","bwikiRevision":58947,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-8774","bwikiMission":"사회적 꿈"}],"orderNote":"공식 사건 도감에 귀속된 한국어 원문입니다. BWIKI에서 확인한 모드별 구간만 연결하며 조건·확률·미확인 경계는 이어 붙이지 않습니다.","bwikiBaseOrder":["swarm-disaster-event-rogue-23-talk-403811801-line","swarm-disaster-event-rogue-23-talk-403811802-line","swarm-disaster-event-rogue-23-talk-403811803-line","swarm-disaster-event-rogue-23-text-17311819012165719387-choice","swarm-disaster-event-rogue-23-text-17565055023392789943-effect","swarm-disaster-event-rogue-23-text-13717816190884124486-choice","swarm-disaster-event-rogue-23-text-13738518218215002057-choice","swarm-disaster-event-rogue-23-text-16133995266322216578-choice"],"bwiki":{"matchedRows":0,"cachedRows":8,"reviewRows":0,"segments":5,"reorderedRows":0},"retainedTextRowIds":[]}